    <h1 style="font-size: var(--text-display-lg);">Non-QM Loans: The Complete Guide</h1>

    <ArticleImage />

    <p class="mt-8">In today's diverse financial landscape, not every borrower fits into the conventional mortgage box. At Cliffco Mortgage Bankers, we understand that traditional qualification methods don't always reflect the true financial strength of many worthy borrowers. That's why we're passionate about providing solutions through Non-QM loans (non-qualified mortgage loans).</p>
    <p class="mt-4">These specialized mortgage loans serve a vital segment of the market that mainstream lenders often overlook. Whether you're self-employed, have unique income streams, or have experienced past credit challenges, Non-QM loans might be the key to achieving your homeownership dreams.</p>
    <p class="mt-4">While qualified mortgage products dominate the market, we recognize that these traditional paths to homeownership don't work for everyone. Our team at Cliffco Mortgage Bankers has developed expertise in the Non-QM sector to ensure that more deserving borrowers can access the funding they need.</p>
    <p class="mt-4">The mortgage loans available in this category provide flexibility without compromising on responsible lending principles. We've found that many borrowers who don't qualify under conventional guidelines are excellent candidates for homeownership when evaluated through alternative methods.</p>
    <p class="mt-4">This comprehensive guide will explore everything you need to know about Non-QM loans, from qualification requirements to the various programs available, helping you determine if this mortgage solution aligns with your financial situation and homeownership goals.</p>

    <nav class="mt-10 p-6 bg-[var(--color-mist-gray)] rounded-xl">
      <p class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-3">Table of Contents</p>
      <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm text-[var(--color-accent)]">
